ApexOracle-Generation
Copyright 2026 ApexOracle contributors

This distribution is based on the Apache-2.0-licensed project
"Simple Guidance Mechanisms for Discrete Diffusion Models":
https://github.com/kuleshov-group/discrete-diffusion-guidance

ApexOracle-specific modifications add SELFIES generation with MIC and peptide
guidance, a remasking schedule, portable release launchers, and integration with
the separately distributed ApexOracle-MDLM and ApexOracle-Core modules.

Model weights, datasets, tokenizer assets, and other external dependencies are
not included in this source repository and remain subject to their respective
licenses and terms.
